WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.250
Twice a day, Jews say the
Shema: Hear, O Israel:

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.240
the LORD our God, the LORD is One.

3
00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.280
One God.

4
00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.500
No partners, no rivals, no parts.

5
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:14.720
The Torah calls this God
merciful and gracious,

6
00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:16.430
holy and just.

7
00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:20.330
But Jewish teaching also says
nothing about God is physical.

8
00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:23.100
So how can anyone say what God is like?

9
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:27.020
In this mission, you'll meet the
Thirteen Principles of Maimonides.

10
00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:31.540
Then you'll compare how different
Jewish movements understand the one God.

11
00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:36.600
Your mission: find out how anyone can
say what a God with no body is like.
